WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.915
Earthlight. A city for the Moon.

2
00:00:04.225 --> 00:00:09.825
Most cities grow around a river.
This one grows around a window.

3
00:00:09.825 --> 00:00:12.150
Issued for construction.

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.700
[stamp thunks]

5
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.800
Lovely.

6
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.696
A kitchen table. Hello to your daughter.

7
00:00:20.224 --> 00:00:23.614
Somebody's always on the moon.

8
00:00:27.974 --> 00:00:30.560
Here? About eight hours tonight.

9
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.940
Where we're building...
three hundred and fifty-four.

10
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:39.069
Phase one is where I went wrong.
Nobody should ever

11
00:00:39.069 --> 00:00:43.100
have to live in phase one.
Let's start it again.

12
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.400
[chime cuts off]

13
00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.400
[silence]

14
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.300
[dull clunk through the floor]

15
00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:55.790
<i>♪ never rises ♪</i>

16
00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.295
<i>♪ never sets ♪</i>

17
00:00:59.599 --> 00:01:00.860
<i>♪ where you left it ♪</i>

18
00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:08.590
They went to get the food. The lander
tipped over. That was eleven days ago.

19
00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:09.595
I know.

20
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.790
Issued for construction.

21
00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:19.580
Goodnight.

22
00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:20.000
Good—

